#, fuzzy
#| msgctxt "Comment"
#| msgid ""
#| "Read the comment on the \"Type 'Hello'\" action first.\\n\\nQt Designer "
#| "uses Ctrl+F4 for closing windows.  In KDE, however, Ctrl+F4 is the "
